  "notes": [
    "Batch 2, labelled by the agent (Claude Opus 5.5 in Claude Code) on 2026-11-26, before skill v2's held-out run (plan 6 step 06). Karlo spot-checks at least 5 cases before that run.",
    "Every candidate looked at, kept or dropped, is in evals/held-out-batch2-log.md with a reason. Cases are kept or dropped by the rules in docs/plans/proof/steps/03-held-out-batch-2.md, never by whether Ward finds them.",
    "Candidates came from the commit history of about 130 open-source Android apps (grep of commit messages from 2026-07-01), their published repository security advisories, library upgrades checked against OSV, and GitHub commit search.",
    "Every fix is newer than both models' training cutoff (June 2026). Line numbers refer to the parent commit. No code from the repos is stored: only URLs, hashes, paths, lines, short anchors and our own words.",
    "Dependency advisories were confirmed with OSV queries on 2026-11-26 for the version in the parent commit.",
    "The onyx-browser fix (HO-28) also changes the network config, JS bridges and an intent scheme; only WebView debugging is labelled. Its user-CA trust was dropped: arguable for a general browser.",
    "Kinds: code 8, absence 2, config 5, dependency 3. Absence cases are few: few fixes after the cutoff add a missing check that is visible statically.",
    "Changed after the reviewer, before any run (2026-11-26): HO-21 and HO-29 of the first freeze dropped, IDs renumbered, HO-17 and HO-22 widened, HO-14 and HO-18 narrowed. The first freeze is in git history (fb1b830)."
